= Sir Geoffrey Howe

[? if con_in_government = 0 : Shadow Chancellor. ?][? if con_in_government = 1 and chancellor = "Howe" : Chancellor of the Exchequer. ?][? if con_in_government = 1 and chancellor != "Howe" : Leader of the House, kept out of the Treasury. ?] Mild in manner and relentless on detail. Denis Healey said being attacked by him was "like being savaged by a dead sheep", but Howe usually wins on the substance.

- @alternative_budget
- @emergency_package
- @city
- @root: Return

@alternative_budget
title: Publish an alternative budget
view-if: con_in_government = 0
subtitle: Undermines Labour's economic credibility.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next Shadow Cabinet action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; labour_credibility -= 4; economic_liberalism += 3; c1_con += 2*(1-dissent)

Howe's alternative budget is costed down to the last million. Even the Financial Times concedes it adds up.

@emergency_package
title: An emergency fiscal package
view-if: con_in_government = 1
subtitle: +2 budget, through mid-year spending cuts. The wets will object.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next Cabinet action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; budget += 2; spending -= 1; wet_dissent += 5; cabinet_revolt += 1 if cabinet_dry < 60

Howe announces a package of mid-year spending cuts to keep borrowing on target. The departments that lose out complain loudly.

@city
title: Reassure the City
subtitle: Gain [+ donations + 2 +] resources.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next Shadow Cabinet action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; resources += donations + 2

A round of lunches in the Square Mile. The City has decided we are the better bet, and it puts its money where its mouth is.
